          <p class="mt-6 text-5xl sm:text-7xl font-black tracking-tight"><span class="text-white/60 text-2xl sm:text-3xl mr-2">상위</span><span data-count="10">10</span><span style="color:var(--gold)">%</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal d1 relative p-7 sm:p-9 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--wine) 0%, #5a1220 100%)">
          <p class="text-xs text-white/70">수능 · 9등급제</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base sm:text-lg font-bold">1등급은, 학생과 함께 만듭니다</p>
          <p class="mt-6 text-5xl sm:text-7xl font-black tracking-tight"><span class="text-white/70 text-2xl sm:text-3xl mr-2">상위</span><span data-count="4">4</span><span style="color:var(--gold)">%</span></p>
        </div>
